---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | KinetixSoft"
  description="Privacy policy and data handling practices for KinetixSoft (kinetixsoft.com)."
  canonicalUrl="https://kinetixsoft.com/privacy/"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: October 25, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p>
        At KinetixSoft (accessible from <a href="https://kinetixsoft.com">https://kinetixsoft.com</a>), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information collected and recorded by KinetixSoft and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you visit our tutorial platform, request a project consultation, or contact our engineering team via forms or email, we may collect:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact information (such as your name, business email address, and company name).</li>
        <li>Project scope details submitted through our contact forms.</li>
        <li>Standard technical log data (IP address, browser type, referral pages, and timestamps) solely for performance diagnostics and DDoS defense.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide, maintain, and optimize our tutorials and web application.</li>
        <li>Respond promptly to project inquiries and schedule technical strategy calls.</li>
        <li>Monitor site performance metrics and prevent security vulnerabilities.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Third-Party Services &amp; Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. We may utilize trusted third-party cloud infrastructure (such as Vercel, Netlify, and Cloudflare) to serve static content securely.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Cookies &amp; Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        KinetixSoft uses minimal local storage solely to store your light/dark theme preference and cached client search index. We do not use third-party tracking or advertising cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@kinetixsoft.com">contact@kinetixsoft.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
